{"162997068040904706":{"id":"162997068040904706","date":"2012-01-27","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Beautiful picture of Earth from the new NASA satellite  http://t.co/uOgyp4vg","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/162997068040904706","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16417},"161663679694241792":{"id":"161663679694241792","date":"2012-01-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Rough cut simulation of the SpaceX next gen rocket & spaceship design  http://t.co/cKBviQne","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/161663679694241792","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16418},"161660285659267072":{"id":"161660285659267072","date":"2012-01-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Design completed for bringing rocket back to launchpad using only thrusters. Yay. Wings r just dead weight in space.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/161660285659267072","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16419},"161645598037123073":{"id":"161645598037123073","date":"2012-01-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Strongest solar radiation storm in 7 years is blasting Earth. This huge eruption hits us tomorrow:  http://t.co/VF3gTu3L","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/161645598037123073","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16420},"161262600800313344":{"id":"161262600800313344","date":"2012-01-23","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Bought some wood and built a little treehouse with my boys. Few more beautiful ways to spend an afternoon.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/161262600800313344","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16421},"160885484120322048":{"id":"160885484120322048","date":"2012-01-22","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@TheOnion I heard Lars von Trier optioned the movie rights","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/160885484120322048","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16422},"159453674517692416":{"id":"159453674517692416","date":"2012-01-18","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"That said, even though they cause me grief, I would defend the right of shorts to exist. They are often unreasonably maligned.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/159453674517692416","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16423},"159396536621596672":{"id":"159396536621596672","date":"2012-01-17","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"That's not just paranoia (a healthy trait at times). Tesla really is under massive attack by short sellers  http://t.co/PUxAOOm2","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/159396536621596672","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16424},"159330976378519552":{"id":"159330976378519552","date":"2012-01-17","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Will communicate better in the future. Too many people want us to fail and are willing to twist any bit of news against Tesla.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/159330976378519552","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16425},"159330380955136001":{"id":"159330380955136001","date":"2012-01-17","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"TSLA down ~$500M Friday, but back up ~$500M today. Sorry for the roller coaster.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/159330380955136001","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16426},"158284645656571904":{"id":"158284645656571904","date":"2012-01-14","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Somebody needs to tell Kim Jong-un that the showbiz phrase \"break a leg\" doesn't mean what he thinks it does","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/158284645656571904","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16427},"158284167891791872":{"id":"158284167891791872","date":"2012-01-14","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Once more, with feeling!  \"North Korea Punishes Insincere Mourners\"  http://t.co/ozqhp1aC","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/158284167891791872","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16428},"157700726515183616":{"id":"157700726515183616","date":"2012-01-13","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"A Tesla Roadster just passed the 100,000 mile mark for the first time and still has over 200 miles of range.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/157700726515183616","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16429},"157599662159835136":{"id":"157599662159835136","date":"2012-01-12","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"What is more magical than cowboys herding cats? Livin' the dream...   http://t.co/1pLhb9lc","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/157599662159835136","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16430},"157569537548623872":{"id":"157569537548623872","date":"2012-01-12","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Kids these days are so grown up! RT \"Second-Graders Wow Audience With School Production Of Equus\"  http://t.co/YgyAIrwI","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/157569537548623872","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16431},"157292663601758208":{"id":"157292663601758208","date":"2012-01-12","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Model S Performance powertrain produced so much torque today that we broke the dyno. 4.4 sec 0-60 mph will not be a problem.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/157292663601758208","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16432},"156927468836630528":{"id":"156927468836630528","date":"2012-01-11","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"The exec conf room at Tesla used to be called Denali, but I decided to move a few letters around. Seemed more apt :)  http://t.co/Raq5UaR6","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/156927468836630528","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16433},"155380533533220864":{"id":"155380533533220864","date":"2012-01-06","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Model S Signature series sold out as of today  https://t.co/pKbR0ziP","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/155380533533220864","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16434},"155340355884167169":{"id":"155340355884167169","date":"2012-01-06","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Next month is also when our Dragon spaceship docks with the Space Station for the first time. Major pucker factor...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/155340355884167169","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16435},"155339851812700160":{"id":"155339851812700160","date":"2012-01-06","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Feb is huge month. Model X world premier and public reveal of our LA design studio on the 9th. Stay tuned for more details.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/155339851812700160","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16436},"154313189079777280":{"id":"154313189079777280","date":"2012-01-03","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Just finished Massie's book on Catherine. An amazingly expansive and compelling portrait of an incredible woman. Highly recommend.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/154313189079777280","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16437},"154307255536324608":{"id":"154307255536324608","date":"2012-01-03","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@om Respectfully disagree. Larry  made awesome moves last year, which laid the foundation for G+ to kick butt in 2012. He's a stud.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/154307255536324608","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16438},"154094195089473536":{"id":"154094195089473536","date":"2012-01-03","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"What everyone really thinks ... RT “@jonlovett: If Mayans were good at predicting the future, there'd be Mayans.”","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/154094195089473536","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16439},"153594528908058624":{"id":"153594528908058624","date":"2012-01-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"On a lighter note, the RHCP are f* awesome. No better way to bring in the New Year...  http://t.co/TlkAdzsk","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153594528908058624","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16440},"153578511687368704":{"id":"153578511687368704","date":"2012-01-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"I said *information* weapons for a reason. The bit is mightier than the bomb.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153578511687368704","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16441},"153576623101313025":{"id":"153576623101313025","date":"2012-01-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"If we are not careful, we will find that knife against liberty's neck. Fate has a great sense of irony.  http://t.co/OQ2u1zHQ","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153576623101313025","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16442},"153574532031070208":{"id":"153574532031070208","date":"2012-01-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"We built powerful information weapons to fight enemies of liberty. Now those enemies are largely defeated, but the weapons remain.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153574532031070208","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16443},"153519464653127680":{"id":"153519464653127680","date":"2012-01-01","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@FareedZakaria However, China's real estate crisis will explode in a way that makes ours look puny. They can't hide it for much longer.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153519464653127680","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16444},"153518263001808896":{"id":"153518263001808896","date":"2012-01-01","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@FareedZakaria Yeah, 2012 will be great for the American economy & jobs, as we've mostly dealt with the overbuilt housing crisis.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153518263001808896","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16445},"153515940707975169":{"id":"153515940707975169","date":"2012-01-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"My first prediction of 2012 has come true: ouch, my head hurts.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153515940707975169","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16446},"153236159361847298":{"id":"153236159361847298","date":"2011-12-31","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"World violence being super low is probably counter-intuitive to most people. That's because modern media is a misery microscope.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153236159361847298","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16447},"153235426126213120":{"id":"153235426126213120","date":"2011-12-31","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Here's a happy thought for 2012: world violence is at an all time historical low. Excellent piece by Stephen Pinker  http://t.co/gv4MLfQe","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153235426126213120","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16448},"153099684280410112":{"id":"153099684280410112","date":"2011-12-31","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Hacked my Tesla charge connector on a small island in the rain last night #whatcouldpossiblygowrong","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/153099684280410112","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16449},"152774892591398913":{"id":"152774892591398913","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Not that this really matters. All current rocket tech, including ours, sucks. Only when it becomes fully reusable, will it not suck.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152774892591398913","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16450},"152763084488982531":{"id":"152763084488982531","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"SpaceX has Boeing, Lockheed, Europe (Ariane) and Russia (Proton/Soyuz) near checkmate in rocket technology. End game is all about China.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152763084488982531","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16451},"152759917621690368":{"id":"152759917621690368","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"China unveils ambitious space strategy  http://t.co/udHmuft2","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152759917621690368","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16452},"152614233278910464":{"id":"152614233278910464","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"To be clear, CtG absolutely did *not* bang her horse. They were just close friends who liked to take showers together and spoon at night.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152614233278910464","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16453},"152602438807994369":{"id":"152602438807994369","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Right mood, scented candles, Barry White singing \"Can't Get Enough of Your Love, Baby\" and the magic (by that I mean horsef*ing) happens ...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152602438807994369","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16454},"152600724222656512":{"id":"152600724222656512","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"I'm just saying that u shouldn't pass judgment based on one night of passion. Sometimes things just happen and u go with the moment :)","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152600724222656512","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16455},"152599413813018624":{"id":"152599413813018624","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Sew one button, doesn't make u a tailor; cook one meal, doesn't make u a chef; but f* one horse and u r a horsef*er for all of history...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152599413813018624","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16456},"152598246475317248":{"id":"152598246475317248","date":"2011-12-30","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Am reading Robert Massie's book on Catherine the Great. Yeah, I know what you're probably thinking ... did she really f* a horse?","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152598246475317248","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16457},"152520590719336448":{"id":"152520590719336448","date":"2011-12-29","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Am not saying that is *necessarily* good or bad, but reality will force us to live with the consequences of our actions  http://t.co/fnXmhUok","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152520590719336448","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16458},"152517033207136256":{"id":"152517033207136256","date":"2011-12-29","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Interesting Economist article about how humanity's collective actions have created a fundamentally new geological age -- the Anthropocene.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152517033207136256","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16459},"152394000857448448":{"id":"152394000857448448","date":"2011-12-29","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@om Cool personal essay. It really resonated with me, as I felt the same way after coming very close to dying from malaria ten years ago.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152394000857448448","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16460},"152315925167742977":{"id":"152315925167742977","date":"2011-12-29","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@richardbranson Liked \"Screw Business as Usual\" a lot. This approach should be taken to heart by all, as it really is the smart move.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152315925167742977","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16461},"152311993636892672":{"id":"152311993636892672","date":"2011-12-29","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@kanyewest Just returned from Haiti. For those who want to help, I recommend donating to MSF, UNICEF and Artists for Peace & Justice.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152311993636892672","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16462},"152153637639028736":{"id":"152153637639028736","date":"2011-12-28","type":"reply","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"@TheOnion So true :)","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/152153637639028736","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16463},"151809315026636800":{"id":"151809315026636800","date":"2011-12-27","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"If you ever wanted to know the *real* truth about the moon landings ...(best Onion article ever)  http://t.co/pgNEJsjI","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151809315026636800","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16464},"151338939389706242":{"id":"151338939389706242","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Walked around a neighborhood recently rebuilt with help from APJ and others  http://t.co/KYHjsS1k","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151338939389706242","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16465},"151337237429239808":{"id":"151337237429239808","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"It was Xmas, so we brought presents for the kids at the orphanage. They don't usually get much.  http://t.co/r8qfluIG","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151337237429239808","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16466},"151327734843445249":{"id":"151327734843445249","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Met with UNICEF, Doctors Without Borders and Artists for Peace & Justice. I support them and would recommend others do too.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151327734843445249","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16467},"151322293174419456":{"id":"151322293174419456","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Just returned from a trip to Haiti. Covered a lot of ground and saw many tough situations. They need a lot of help.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151322293174419456","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16468},"151317672217419777":{"id":"151317672217419777","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Single character Tweets are the ulitmate extension of the Twitmeme...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151317672217419777","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16469},"151151777662779392":{"id":"151151777662779392","date":"2011-12-26","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"I","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/151151777662779392","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16470},"150390624552615937":{"id":"150390624552615937","date":"2011-12-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"The Russians are having some challenges with their rockets. Too many of the engineers that designed them have retired:  http://t.co/rEs7spSU","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/150390624552615937","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16471},"150388617246801920":{"id":"150388617246801920","date":"2011-12-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"We had a long and interesting conversation on many subjects. He has exciting ideas for extending his creative talents beyond music.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/150388617246801920","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16472},"150387544402575360":{"id":"150387544402575360","date":"2011-12-24","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Kanye stopped by the SpaceX rocket factory today.  http://t.co/6z7gHBn6","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/150387544402575360","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16473},"149813972915339264":{"id":"149813972915339264","date":"2011-12-22","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Model S options are out! Performance in red and black for me.  I will deliver my car in June/July.  http://t.co/acnyP4nh","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149813972915339264","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16474},"149787827712958464":{"id":"149787827712958464","date":"2011-12-22","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Hi, I'm Art Garfunkel. Have you heard the sound of silence? Because, you know, it makes a sound...  http://t.co/7vgya9xL","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149787827712958464","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16475},"149688828599349251":{"id":"149688828599349251","date":"2011-12-22","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Raul Campos invited me to do a guest DJ gig on KCRW.  Hear my random holiday season music selections at  http://t.co/o6FQASvC","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149688828599349251","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16476},"149629518267695104":{"id":"149629518267695104","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Yum! Even better than deep fried butter:  http://t.co/Ody21NuD","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149629518267695104","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16477},"149447517325635584":{"id":"149447517325635584","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Yeah, this really is me, as my Mom @mayemusk will attest. Not sure I can handle just doing 140 char missives. Will put longer thoughts on G+","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149447517325635584","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16478},"149444078210256896":{"id":"149444078210256896","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Got called randomly by Kanye West today and received a download of his thoughts, ranging from shoes to Moses. He was polite, but opaque.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149444078210256896","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16479},"149441101684686848":{"id":"149441101684686848","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"His singing and acting talent will be sorely missed:   http://t.co/IIFKob75 South Park sequel coming soon...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149441101684686848","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16480},"149439686702661632":{"id":"149439686702661632","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Why does the crowd cry over the glorious leader Kim Il Sung's death?  Fear of being shot may play a role:   http://t.co/hoQrYtG1","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149439686702661632","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16481},"149436471764459520":{"id":"149436471764459520","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Sam Harris also wrote a nice piece on the awesomeness of Hitchens:  http://t.co/fPkLiK3v May the good man RIP.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149436471764459520","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16482},"149435658115612672":{"id":"149435658115612672","date":"2011-12-21","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Read \"Lying\", the new book by my friend Sam Harris.  Excellent cover art and lots of good reasons not to lie!","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/149435658115612672","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16483},"143171132814671872":{"id":"143171132814671872","date":"2011-12-04","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Am reading a great biography of Ben Franklin by Isaacson. Highly recommended.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/143171132814671872","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16484},"142881284019060736":{"id":"142881284019060736","date":"2011-12-03","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"That was a total non sequitur btw","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/142881284019060736","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16485},"142880871391838208":{"id":"142880871391838208","date":"2011-12-03","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Great Voltaire quote, arguably better than Twain. Hearing news of his own death, Voltaire replied the reports were true, only premature.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/142880871391838208","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16486},"142188458125963264":{"id":"142188458125963264","date":"2011-12-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"I made the volume on the Model S  http://t.co/wMCnT53M go to 11.  Now I just need to work in a miniature Stonehenge...","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/142188458125963264","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16487},"142179928203460608":{"id":"142179928203460608","date":"2011-12-01","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Went to Iceland on Sat to ride bumper cars on ice!  No, not the country, Vlad's rink in Van Nuys. Awesome family fun :)  http://t.co/rBQXJ9IT","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/142179928203460608","verified":false,"sourceStatus":"archive_record","archiveDataset":"18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a","archiveRow":16488},"15434727182":{"id":"15434727182","date":"2010-06-04","type":"original","typeBasis":"text_inference","text":"Please ignore prior tweets, as that was someone pretending to be me :)  This is actually me.","source":"https://github.com/MohrezSheikh/Elon-Musk-Tweets/blob/18bee13cf1acb251087343221478bf76ab45ee1a/ElonMusk%27sTweets.csv","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/sta